  "description": {
   "content": [
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Fedora appears to be changing the millisecond portion of datetimes in RDF for fedora:created but not for dc:date. For example, it goes from \"2012-03-22T14:18:22.800Z\" to \"2012-03-22T14:18:22.8Z\". My understanding is that it should not make this change, but it is worth investigating.",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "To test, you'll need to start fedora in relaxed mode:",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "java -Dfcrepo.properties.management=relaxed -jar fcrepo-webapp-5.1.0-jetty-console.jar",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Create with fedora:created",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -XPOST -H\"Content-Type: text/turtle\" --data-binary \"<> <http://fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#created>\r\n                \\\"2012-03-22T14:18:22.800Z\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>\" http://localhost:8080/rest/\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl http://localhost:8080/rest/fcfa41c1-1519-41ef-8027-7ae200f8720d\r\n#        fedora:created         \"2012-03-22T14:18:22.8Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    },
    {
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "Create with dc:date",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "paragraph"
    },
    {
     "attrs": {
      "language": "java"
     },
     "content": [
      {
       "text": "curl -XPOST -H\"Content-Type: text/turtle\" --data-binary \"<> <http://purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date>\r\n                \\\"2012-03-22T14:18:22.800Z\\\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime>\" http://localhost:8080/rest/\r\n\r\n\r\ncurl http://localhost:8080/rest/da83c0f8-c15f-4730-b2cc-396d0b033371\r\n#         dc:date                \"2012-03-22T14:18:22.800Z\"^^<http://www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime> ;",
       "type": "text"
      }
     ],
     "type": "codeBlock"
    }
   ],
