  "description": "<p>Fedora appears to be changing the millisecond portion of datetimes in RDF for fedora:created but not for dc:date. For example, it goes from \"2012-03-22T14:18:22.800Z\" to \"2012-03-22T14:18:22.8Z\". My understanding is that it should not make this change, but it is worth investigating.</p>\n\n<p>To test, you'll need to start fedora in relaxed mode:</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\njava -Dfcrepo.properties.management=relaxed -jar fcrepo-webapp-5.1.0-jetty-console.jar</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>Create with fedora:created</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -XPOST -H<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Content-Type: text/turtle\"</span> --data-binary \"&lt;&gt; &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//fedora.info/definitions/v4/repository#created&gt;\r\n</span>                \\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"2012-03-22T14:18:22.800Z\\\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt;\" http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/\r\n</span>\r\n\r\ncurl http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/fcfa41c1-1519-41ef-8027-7ae200f8720d\r\n</span>#        fedora:created         <span class=\"code-quote\">\"2012-03-22T14:18:22.8Z\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;</span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>\n<p>Create with dc:date</p>\n<div class=\"code panel\" style=\"border-width: 1px;\"><div class=\"codeContent panelContent\">\n<pre class=\"code-java\">\r\ncurl -XPOST -H<span class=\"code-quote\">\"Content-Type: text/turtle\"</span> --data-binary \"&lt;&gt; &lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//purl.org/dc/elements/1.1/date&gt;\r\n</span>                \\<span class=\"code-quote\">\"2012-03-22T14:18:22.800Z\\\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt;\" http://localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/\r\n</span>\r\n\r\ncurl http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//localhost:8080/<span class=\"code-keyword\">rest</span>/da83c0f8-c15f-4730-b2cc-396d0b033371\r\n</span>#         dc:date                <span class=\"code-quote\">\"2012-03-22T14:18:22.800Z\"</span>^^&lt;http:<span class=\"code-comment\">//www.w3.org/2001/XMLSchema#dateTime&gt; ;</span>\r\n</pre>\n</div></div>",
